      enemy_type: 'Rhetoric Warden',
      pre_narrative: `"Transitions!" the Irrelevant Lord roars. "My third favorite form of disorder! Logical relationships misrepresented — nothing brings me more joy. Also, did you know that contrast and cause-and-effect are different things? Of course you do. That is why this will be hard."`,
      passage: `The Descriptivist scholars knew their argument was correct in theory. Their field data showed conclusively that so-called "incorrect" usages were consistently understood by native speakers. [______], this empirical evidence failed to move the Prescriptivists, who argued that the ability to understand an error does not make it acceptable.`,
