      pre_narrative: `"The fifteenth question!" the Irrelevant Lord shouts. "Only five remain after this. You are making me work harder than I have in decades. Also, I have not worked hard in decades. Also that is irrelevant. The transition question is about an unnecessary transition. The hardest kind."`,
      passage: `The founding charter of Grammar Keep was ratified unanimously. [Moreover], all three clan leaders signed it in the same ceremony on the same day.`,
      question_stem: `Which version of the underlined transition is BEST?`,
      option_a: `Moreover`,
