      success_narrative: `The passage stands in perfect order: claim, examples, synthesis, explanation. The Irrelevant Lord pauses. The scroll-pile throne shivers. And then, slowly, impossibly, the Irrelevant Lord bows. "The Rhetoric Ruins are yours, Scholar. You have answered twenty questions without missing a single relevant point. I am — though it pains me to say it — genuinely impressed." He dissolves into a cloud of perfectly organized, completely purposeful dust. The ancient inscriptions blaze with golden light.`,
